# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
plan.txt
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Local-only config / secrets
backend.hcl
bootstrap/terraform.tfvars
*.secret.tfvars
.env

